/* UEF Landship 01 Yaw/Pitch and Firenode Layout

Primary 01 - Top Front -  Yaw01 - FN01 FN02

Secondary 01 - Bottom Front - Yaw14 - FN31 FN32
Secondary 02 - Top Back - Yaw03 - FN05 FN06
Secondary 03 - Front Left - Yaw04 - FN07 FN08
Secondary 04 - Front Right - Yaw05 - FN09 FN10
Secondary 05 - Left Middle - Yaw06 - FN23 FN24 FN25 FN26 - Quad
Secondary 06 - Right Middle - Yaw07 - FN27 FN28 FN28 FN30 - Quad
Secondary 07 - Left Back - Yaw08 - FN19 FN20
Secondary 08 - Right Back - Yaw09 - FN21 FN22
Secondary 09 - Bottom Front Left - YAW10 - FN11 FN12
Secondary 10 - Bottom Front Right - YAW11 - FN13 FN14
Secondary 11 - Bottom Back Left - YAW12 - FN15 FN16
Secondary 12 - Bottom Back Right - YAW13 - FN17 FN18

Teriary 01 - Top Middle - Yaw02 - FN03 FN04
*/


